## Meditate alpha — 10 Hz alpha binaural over a soft pink bed
##
## 200 Hz carrier, 10 Hz beat (alpha). Gentle amplitudes; keep
## playback volume low, the tones just above the bed.
##
## Headphones required. Render:
##   entrain render meditate-alpha.sbg -f flac

all-off: -

meditate-alpha: pink/15 200+10/25

0:00:00 meditate-alpha
1:00:00 all-off
